SUMMARY:An Evening of Jazz with The Gallery Trio
DESCRIPTION:This three-piece band plays jazz like you’ve never heard before. Burjor Dastur on guitar\, Mike Varga on bass\, and Joey Waterman on drums play compositions by Wayne Shorter\, Kenny Burrell\, Chick Corea\, Wes Montgomery\, Joe Henderson\, Sonny Rollins\, and Charles Mingus. Don’t miss this concert\, played with heart and soul. Hors d’oeuvres\, pizza and beverages included (until we run out). FREE\, and all donations benefit COTS of Petaluma.
