SUMMARY:4th Annual Phoenix Pride Benefit Showcase
DESCRIPTION:Retro Pride. Live art. Big love. Dance all night. Support LGBTQIA+ community magic. 🌈✨\nPhoenix Pride Benefit Showcase – 4th Annual Retro Celebration 🌈✨\nPhoenix Dance Team proudly presents our 4th Annual Pride Benefit Showcase—a night of performance\, community\, and retro-inspired celebration honoring both the past and present of LGBTQIA+ artistry.\nThis year’s showcase leans into a retro theme\, paying tribute to the eras when queer expression found its voice through music\, dance floors\, and underground performance spaces.\nEnjoy a spectrum of performers including burlesque\, drag\, vocalists\, and dance\, along with representatives from each organization sharing insights on the meaningful work that they do.\nProceeds from ticket sales will benefit:\n💖 Positive Images\n💖 Amor Para Todos\n💖 VIDAS\n💸 Pro tip: Bring some cash!\nWe’ll be embracing a lively tipping culture throughout the night—so you can shower extra love on our performers and support the magic happening onstage. Think of it as honoring the tradition of community-supported performance that has long been part of queer nightlife and culture.\nAnd the night doesn’t end when the curtain falls…\n🪩 Stay for our annual post-show retro dance party!\nAfter the showcase\, the venue transforms into a dance floor where we come together to celebrate\, connect\, and keep the Pride spirit alive\nCome for the show.\nStay for the party.\nLeave with a full heart and a little disco sparkle.\nJoin us for a night of art\, advocacy\, and Pride—retro style. \nTickets $20 in advance\, $25 at the door. Doors open 6:30pm.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/4th-annual-phoenix-pride-benefit-showcase/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Dance Performance
