DESCRIPTION:The 28th Annual Healdsburg Jazz Festival (June 12–21) is already shaping up to be extraordinary\, featuring legendary saxophonist Branford Marsalis and acclaimed Grammy-winning vocalist Cécile McLorin Salvant\, with more exciting artists to be announced soon. \nThe Healdsburg Jazz Festival glides toward the summer with its most ambitious program to date (June 12-21\, 2026). Presenting a series of must-see concerts in beautiful venues\, from wineries and restaurants to public plazas and historic theaters\, the Festival once again features a brilliant array of some of the world’s most celebrated musicians. \n  \nThe Healdsburg Jazz Festival glides toward the summer with its most ambitious program to date (June 12-21\, 2026). Presenting a series of must-see concerts in beautiful venues\, from wineries and restaurants to public plazas and historic theaters\, the Festival once again features a brilliant array of some of the world’s most celebrated musicians. \nURL: \nTickets: https://go.evvnt.com/3571425-0?pid=5514 \nPrice: General Admission: USD 75.00 \nDate and Time: 12 – 21 Jun 2026\, 7 PM – 9 PM \nCategory: Live Music | Jazz \nVenue Details: Healdsburg\, California\, 95448\, United States
