SUMMARY:Dry Creek Station at Mazzocco Winery
DESCRIPTION:Experience an unforgettable evening of live music\, wine\, and Sonoma County views as Dry Creek Station returns to Mazzocco Winery in Healdsburg. Known for their energetic live shows and crowd-favorite blend of modern country\, classic rock\, and dance hits\, Dry Creek Station delivers a fun\, feel-good performance featuring powerful male/female harmonies and a dynamic seven-piece band. \nSet among the vineyards of Dry Creek Valley\, Mazzocco Winery offers the perfect wine country atmosphere to relax with friends\, enjoy award-winning wines\, and take in live music under the open sky. Bring your dancing shoes and enjoy one of Sonoma County’s favorite bands in one of the region’s most scenic winery settings.
