SUMMARY:Feather & Flow: Live Music & Burlesque in Guerneville CA
DESCRIPTION:Thotty McNaughty presents an evening of classic soulful covers from Award-Winning Cabaret Chanteuse Coco Lamarr. In 2025\, she launched The Winehouse Revival\, a soul-soaked\, immersive tribute show celebrating the music and legacy of Amy Winehouse\, which has quickly become a highlight of California’s live music and cabaret scene. Coco will be backed by LBZ\, a revolutionary hip hop artist known for his energetic shows with a live band. You will enjoy original pieces from LBZ intermixed with Coco’s soulful covers and burlesque performances by Rebel Rose\, Thotty McNaughty\, Alotta Boutte\, Kim\, Montana Skye\, and Andy Rose. \nHeld at the historic\, rustic-charming Rio Nido Lodge located near Guerneville in Sonoma County. Situated among redwoods near the Russian River\, it offers cozy rooms and cabins\, a popular onsite bar/lounge making it a perfect venue for this one of a kind intimate experiance! \nLimited: Enjoy the show in style with a reserved VIP table for four guests\, complete with one bottle of bubbly and a curated charcuterie board. \nThe Rio Nido Lodge: 4444 Wood Rd\, Guerneville\, CA 95446
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/feather-flow-live-music-burlesque-in-guerneville-ca/
