SUMMARY:Forbidden Kiss LIVE - California PRIDE
DESCRIPTION:Join Cheryl King and the rest of the Queer-dos and Weirdos for our California Pride celebration!\nWe’ve got Deaja Girl on Fire and Mimic Velour with burlesque\, plus drag and other wacky offerings from Titus Androgynous and Ophelia Coeur de Noir. Underground Improv is on hand with more of their Stage Left sketches and improv routines\, and Reilly Milton and Erica Ambrin have great musical sets to finish off the night.\nWe’re loud! We’re proud! And we hope you’ll bring your rainbow outfits and support for the cause to The California and play with us!\nPURCHASE IN ADVANCE AND SAVE! PLUS RESERVE A TABLE WITH OUR ZONE TICKET OPTION\nReserved seating in Zone A $27\, Zone B $22\, Zone C $17 (does not guarantee seating) Tickets at the door $27 (seating not guaranteed).\nDoors open 6:30pm. Show starts promptly at 7:30pm.\nAdult material. 18+\nOur kitchen serves our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission. (Kitchen available only at events with 60 or more advance tickets sold)
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/forbidden-kiss-live-california-pride/
